@StudentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### 1. Get All Students
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Student By ID
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add Student
POST {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "age": 22
}

### 4. Update Student
PUT {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "age": 23
}

### 5. Delete Student
DELETE {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Accept: application/json
